Byron A Jeff wrote:
> Helm of brilliance
> Speed Boots
> Spellbook of cure sickness (which is not critical because !FH is available)

I'd go for +HasteSelf over speed boots.  Stack it up (you have the
eya) and wear jumping boots (jumping spell is longer range, but you
have to burn mana at the time of use; haste self you can spend mana
ahead of time).

+CureSickness I've always felt was one of the more useless spellbooks
in the game, I'm curious as to what you'd want it for (you're neutral,
right?  so !holy water will cure sickness for you, though in practice
a blessed unihorn is normally fine)

Helm of brilliance is nice.  I'd want haste self, identify, magic
mapping, detect monsters, and a few others, so if you lack several
than /polymorph might be the way to go to get them.

Markers are always a good wish too.

I usually wind up with most of the charges from the Castle wand still
in my pack when I ascend unless the RNG is particularly stingy.



